From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v0lumehi <aljic.zijad@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 18:36:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ios shell: compile the in-game menu, so the gear opens it

DmGamepad.m's gear (the in-game menu button) calls dm_game_menu,
which only GameMenu.swift defines, and the shell did not compile it.
The shell now compiles GameMenu.swift and LauncherSettings.swift, as
the Duo harness does. In the shell the menu's model is nil, so it has
the controller layouts and Quit, which opens the quit prompt.

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: The route C shell is the fork's (0050): its gear needs GameMenu.swift, without it the shell does not link at the 641d148 pin
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#421
---
 dm/ios/Shell/Shell-Bridging-Header.h | 1 +
 dm/ios/project-shell.yml             | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/dm/ios/Shell/Shell-Bridging-Header.h b/dm/ios/Shell/Shell-Bridging-Header.h
index bf778b2..d7f5196 100644
--- a/dm/ios/Shell/Shell-Bridging-Header.h
+++ b/dm/ios/Shell/Shell-Bridging-Header.h
@@ -1,2 +1,3 @@
 // What ShellApp.swift calls in the engine glue (ShellMain.m).
 #include "ShellEngine.h"
+#include "../Sources/DmGameMenu.h"   // GameMenu.swift, the in-game menu (dm/ios/Sources)
diff --git a/dm/ios/project-shell.yml b/dm/ios/project-shell.yml
index 7c413de..6ff2abd 100644
--- a/dm/ios/project-shell.yml
+++ b/dm/ios/project-shell.yml
@@ -25,6 +25,8 @@ targets:
       - path: Shell           # the shell's main, its scene, the library and the real GameLauncher (dm/ios/Shell)
       - path: Sources/front_ios.m   # the game view, unchanged from the one-game app; ShellMain.m provides what it takes from main.m
       - path: Sources/DmGamepad.m
+      - path: Sources/GameMenu.swift   # the in-game menu the gamepad's gear opens: in the shell the layouts and Quit (no settings screen model)
+      - path: Sources/LauncherSettings.swift   # GameMenu.swift's model type
       - path: Sources/CloudSaves.m
       - path: Sources/SaveSync.m
       - path: Sources/DataBookmark.m
